1
00:00:14,496 --> 00:00:20,252
Bonjour, Marinette ! Regarde le cercle bleu.
Hello, Marinette! Look at the blue circle.

2
00:00:20,352 --> 00:00:25,868
Bonjour, Adrien ! Le carré est rouge.
Hello, Adrien! The square is red.

3
00:00:25,968 --> 00:00:30,044
Le triangle est vert, et le cercle est rond.
The triangle is green, and the circle is round.

4
00:00:30,144 --> 00:00:33,380
La petite forme est jaune.
The little shape is yellow.

5
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:36,836
Voilà un petit carré noir.
Here is a little black square.

6
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:41,780
Merci ! Le cercle blanc est joli.
Thanks! The white circle is pretty.

7
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:45,284
Tu préfères le triangle rouge ?
Do you prefer the red triangle?

8
00:00:45,384 --> 00:00:49,244
Oui, il est très beau, merci.
Yes, it is very nice, thanks.
